  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop CX 200 2024 is a control-oriented performance racquet designed for advanced players seeking precision, feel and stability in a more forgiving package than the CX 200 TOUR. Its 98 sq.in head, 305 g unstrung weight and 315 mm head-light balance provide excellent maneuverability and confidence from both the baseline and the net. SONIC CORE with Infinergy improves rebound and vibration absorption, VIBROSHIELD enhances comfort and feel, POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ supports spin and power, while CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY improves stability and swing-through.",

    "zh": "Dunlop CX 200 2024 是一款偏控制与精准的高性能球拍，采用98平方英寸拍面、305克空拍重量及315毫米头轻平衡设计。相比 CX 200 TOUR，它更容易驾驭，同时仍保持出色的稳定性、击球手感与线路控制。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹与减震表现，VIBROSHIELD 改善舒适性，POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ 增强旋转与力量表现，而 CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY 则进一步提升拍框稳定性与挥拍效率。适合高级底线型及全场型球员。"
  },

